<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῡσιάω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῡσιόων</span>:—intr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow, puff, snort, breathe hard,
				pant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι φυσιόωντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.227
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.506
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθοις ἀνδροκμῆσι φυσιᾷ σπλάγχνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					248
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσιῶν . . ἐκβάλλει ῥοὴν . . φοινίου
					σταλάγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1238
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσφ᾽ ὁ δαίμων οὔρια φυσιάει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cerc.
					4.49
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hiss,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσιόωσα ἔχις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.439
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.262
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>to be puffed up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Naumach.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
